#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-mounting.rst:5 93aaa75bcedf4828940ce8dd7c4c59cc
msgid "Traditional Helicopter – Mounting the Autopilot to the Frame"
msgstr "传统直升机——将飞控安装到机架上"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-mounting.rst:7 71448fcb7c174520b2e8d065779c149c
msgid ""
"On larger helicopters of approximately 550-class or larger the autopilot has"
" been mounted in various locations such as on the FBL unit tray, on top of "
"the tail drive case, or even on the side of the frame (very popular). The "
"video below discusses some considerations when mounting your autopilot on a "
"helicopter."
msgstr ""
"在约 550 级或更大型的直升机上，飞控已被安装在各种位置，如 FBL "
"单元托盘上、尾传动箱顶部，甚至机架侧面（非常流行）。以下视频讨论了在直升机上安装飞控时需要考虑的一些因素。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-mounting.rst:13
#: f706861f841444869e42dadd31c86268
msgid ""
"Below is a possible method to mount a full-size autopilot on a smaller sized"
" helicopter. The Pixracer is popular on smaller frames that have less "
"mounting options. All in one boards such as Matek F405-WSE are also good "
"choices. Any ArduPilot supported autopilot with the required number of "
"outputs for your configuration, and the ability to attach a GPS and remotely"
" mounted Compass (internal compasses sometimes have too much motor "
"electrical interference, especially on boards with integrated current "
"sensor) can be used."
msgstr ""
"以下是在小型直升机上安装全尺寸飞控的一种可行方法。Pixracer 在安装选项较少的小型机架上很受欢迎。Matek F405-WSE "
"等一体化板也是不错的选择。任何 ArduPilot 支持的、具有所需输出数量且能连接 GPS "
"和远程安装罗盘（内置罗盘有时会受到过多电机电气干扰，特别是集成电流传感器的板子）的飞控均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-mounting.rst:17
#: e3f75e3cfa1344ab8bfdd8d3d9a96caf
msgid "Separate the helicopter's main body from its landing gear"
msgstr "将直升机主体与起落架分离"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-mounting.rst:18
#: a8cf01b05cb64f3aa89dbe54585470a0
msgid ""
"Attach one carbon fibre plate to the body, the other to the landing gear"
msgstr "将一块碳纤维板附着到机体上，另一块附着到起落架上"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-mounting.rst:20
#: 17c04aac12fb48b59cc29a224c2a1fa7
msgid ""
"Drill holes in the upper and lower mounting plates so that the plates can be"
" attached with four strong 3cm or 4cm stand-offs"
msgstr "在上下安装板上钻孔，以便用四个坚固的 3cm 或 4cm 支柱连接两块板"

#: ../../source/docs/trad-heli-mounting.rst:22
#: 0cfccb25e9da478d8a9bb9290fee6f6c
msgid ""
"Mount the autopilot to the bottom mounting plate using vibration dampening "
"foam (see :ref:`Vibration Dampening wiki page <common-vibration-damping>` "
"for ideas on mounting methods to isolate the autopilot from vibrations)"
msgstr ""
"使用减震泡沫将飞控安装到下方安装板上（有关隔离飞控震动的安装方法，参见 :ref:`减震 Wiki 页面 <common-vibration-"
"damping>`）"
